<title>USA: Sioux City hogs $1.00-1.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs $1.00-1.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00-1.50 higher compared to Monday. Top $57.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     56.50-57.00</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     56.00-56.50</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     54.00-55.50</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     52.00-53.50</p>
<p>Sows:  1.00-2.50 higher. Top 49.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-450 lbs	45.50</p>
<p>	   450-500 lbs	46.00-46.50</p>
<p>	   500-550 lbs	48.50</p>
<p>	   550-700 lbs	49.50</p>
</text>
